Hide the session picker when only one session is installed (krytis #1588).

With niri gone (#1567), Umbriel is the only session, and noctalia-greeter v1.7.0
still draws a one-entry session picker. This mirrors showsUserDropdown() (users > 1):
showsSessionSelector() is sessions > 1. When it's false the panel reserves no
row or gap for the picker, hides its nodes, drops it from the Tab focus ring,
and makes F3 and toggleSessionMenu() no-ops. With two or more sessions, nothing
changes.

Krytis-only carry for now. Proposing it upstream is the owner's call (Upstream Gate).

